Dear Martin

Don't get confused between error and warnings! This is only a warning, that I added at some point, but I should rephrase it, as actually it still uses the right threshold value of, as you can verify with: summary(tv) So the warning message is not really to be taken into account.
And yes, the th1=list(exact=0) means you are imposing the value of 0, which is I guess exactly what you wanted to do?

Best

Matthieu

